---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Videos
description: Canadian Highlander videos to learn the format, watch people try it for the first time, and catch full matches from LoadingReadyRun's North 100.
pageClass: videos
permalink: /videos/
---
<header class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Videos</p>
    <h1 class="page-head__title">Watch some Canlander</h1>
    <p class="page-head__lede">A lot of people pick up the format by watching it first. These are some of the best videos we've found, from quick explainers to full matches.</p>
    <nav class="vidnav" aria-label="Video sections">
      {%- for sec in videos.sections %}<a href="#{{ sec.id }}">{{ sec.title }}</a>{% endfor %}
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap">
  {%- for sec in videos.sections %}
  <section class="vidsec" id="{{ sec.id }}">
    <div class="section__head section__head--split">
      <h2 class="h2">{{ sec.title }}</h2>
      <p class="section__lede">{{ sec.blurb }}{% if sec.playlist %} <a href="{{ sec.playlist.url }}">{{ sec.playlist.label }}</a>{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="vidgrid">
      {%- for v in sec.videos %}
      <li>
        <a class="vid" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v={{ v.id }}">
          <span class="vid__thumb"><img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/{{ v.id }}/hqdefault.jpg" alt="" width="480" height="360" loading="lazy"><span class="vid__play" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
          <span class="vid__title">{{ v.title }}</span>
          <span class="vid__channel mono">{{ v.channel }}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
  {%- endfor %}

  <aside class="suggest">
    <div>
      <h2 class="h3">Know a video that should be here?</h2>
      <p>Open an issue on GitHub with the link.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ site.issues }}?title=Video%20suggestion">Suggest a video ↗</a>
  </aside>
</div>
